# Rule: Project Context Overview
# Type: Always
# Description: Provides high-level context about the project structure and stack.
# Repository Context
- Backend: `backend/` (Python 3.12, FastAPI, Pydantic, SQLAlchemy)
- Frontend: `frontend/` (React 18, TypeScript strict, Vite, Zustand, Tailwind CSS, Leaflet)
- Infrastructure: `infra/` (Docker Compose, deploy scripts, Nginx)
- Sample Data: `sample_data/` (for testing ADS-B ingest and airport data)
- Docs: `docs/` (Project standards, PRD, API/WS schemas, ADRs)
- Key Technologies: Redis (caching, state), PostgreSQL (if using relational DB alongside Redis), WebSocket (real-time communication)
- Core Functionality: Real-time flight tracking map game, room-based multiplayer, flight data ingestion from ADS-B.

# Key Files & Schemas
- API Specification: `@docs/api_openapi.yaml` (Auto-generated via `make openapi`)
- WebSocket Schema: `@docs/ws_schema.yaml`
- Project Standards: `@docs/project-standards.md`
- Product Requirements: `@docs/PRD.md`
- Tech Debt Log: `@TECH_DEBT.md`
- Architecture Decisions: `@ADR/` directory
